      "content": "thanks for that. i get what you're saying about being inclusive. but i've been hearing a lot of people online saying that teaching kids about gender being fluid is actually confusing for them at that age and that we should just stick to biological facts. why is the spectrum approach considered the \"correct\" or better way to do it, compared to just explaining it as male and female?",
